Package: FinancePackage
Type: Package
Title: FinPack: Financial Data Cleaning and Visualization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Derek", "Fernandez-Davies", email = "derekfernandezdavies@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The goal of this package is to provide tools for cleaning, formatting, and visualizing historical stock market data. 
    This package is designed for financial analysts who need to prepare messy financial data for machine learning and predictive modeling without creating their own cleaning functions.
